flowchart TD
  SRC[Remote source URLs] --> R[catalog research]
  R --> CAS[(Snapshot store<br/>sources/text/sha256.txt)]
  R -->|fetch or CAS error| FC[Fail closed]

  DRAFT[Extract draft] --> E[catalog extract]
  E -->|invalid| FC
  CAS --> V[catalog verify]
  DRAFT --> V
  V -->|evidence mismatch| FC
  V --> W[catalog write]

  W --> ENT[(entries/*.json in git)]
  ENT --> G[catalog graph build]
  G --> KGX[(graph/nodes.jsonl<br/>graph/edges.jsonl)]
  ENT --> D[catalog dedup]
  D -->|strong ID| MERGE[Auto-merge]
  D -->|else| FLAG[(merge_candidates.jsonl)]

  KGX --> L[catalog lint + sigma checks]
  L -->|fail| FC
  KGX --> Q[catalog query get / search]
